flowchart TD
  U[Student] --> UI[Streamlit frontend]
  UI --> API[FastAPI + Pydantic v2]
  API --> G[LangGraph workflow controller]
  G -->|Policy and procedure| RAG[Sentence Transformers + persistent ChromaDB]
  G -->|Personal record and eligibility| T[Deterministic Python tools]
  T --> DB[(SQLite: students, courses, attendance, results, rule registry)]
  RAG --> V[Evidence, source-precedence and safety checks]
  DB --> V
  V --> L[Local Qwen through Ollama]
  L --> Q[Response and citation validation]
  Q --> A[Answer + citations + trace ID + audit]
  ING[POST /ingest: upload + metadata] --> EXT[Extract and chunk text]
  EXT --> RAG
  EXT --> SR[(SQLite source register)]
  ADMIN[Candidate rule validation + activation] --> DB
